# Pairs with NoStrandedFence. The participant drops its shadow on a failed cutover,
# so a redelivered own-saga commit loses the prepare's authority.
MODULE: PeerRestoreCutoverFailureDropsShadow
TARGET: NoStrandedFence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed cutover discards the cached shadow, so a redelivered decision cannot finish as decided
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
          ELSE /\ fence' = "unblocked"
               /\ cache' = t
               /\ obs' = Obs("cutoverFailed"
--- REPLACE
          ELSE /\ fence' = "unblocked"
               /\ cache' = NoShadow
               /\ obs' = Obs("cutoverFailed"
--- END
